      "model_answer_md": "|-8.64| is greater than 1, so demand is **elastic**.\n\nWhen demand is elastic a price reduction increases quantity demanded by a **greater percentage** than the price decline, so revenue rises.\n\nSo AT&T should **lower its price**.",
